  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support Measures Facility BW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the support measures is to contribute to the implementation of Botswana&#xbf;s development agenda and support EU &#xbf; Botswana partnership, by promoting dialogue, expertise exchange, communication activities and engagement with civil society,The Action includes two main components: (1) the Cooperation Facility (EUR 1.400,000) targeting capacity development of Government institutions, dialogues in areas of strategic interest, strategic communication and public diplomacy activities towards the wider public and specialised audiences to raise awareness of the EU-Botswana partnership, as well as peer-to-peer knowledge exchanges, and (2) the Support to CSOs (EUR 1 million) aiming at strengthening CSOs role as actors of governance in the area of public advocacy, transparency and democratic governance. It will also strengthen platforms for dialogue and exchanges in priority areas for the EU, including gender, human rights and youth engagement.In response to the each of the two components two respective main outcomes are expected from this Action: (1)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the successful implementation of the Government&#xbf;s Development Strategy through the support of sound development programmes and ad hoc activities financed from the NDICI-Global Europe and other EU sources, as well as the implementation of the Strategic Communication and Public Diplomacy. &amp;nbsp;And, (2)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the support to civil society to strengthen capacity and maintain CSO&#xbf;s important role in the space of civic participation, democratic governance and implementation of country&#xbf;s development agenda.The Action is fully aligned with sections 3.1 and 3.2 of the MIP 2021-2027 measures in support of civil society and cooperation facility and its objectives.This action will include among other things funding for technical assistance, capacity development and institutional strengthening measures, strategic communication, research and studies, training, conference and other related activities.</narrative>
  </description>
